      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 10:04:20 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa674ca49a40.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa674d194904.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e76ba35e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e76dd24c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e7702c2a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e77708e0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e77d3ed0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e77dca3a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e77e9d70.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e781dfb4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e78240c4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e78dadf0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e78e2497.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e790f2b8.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e796c7a4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e79b3b13.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e79bb041.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e79df825.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e79e487b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e7a26696.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e7a281f5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e7a287bc.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e7a6192d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94ec7cdeb0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaaa03841bbb.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaaa038c0a85.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;Support&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you like my mods and want to buy me a coffee:&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://xn--kofi-m86a.com/kento1911" target="_blank"&gt;https://ko‑fi.com/kento1911&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Support is completely optional, all mods remain &lt;b&gt;100% free&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;Introduction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;I've always wanted a mod that lets Guardians help Link fight enemies, but I couldn't figure out how to make it work — I tried many times without success. Over the past two years, while researching Tears of the Kingdom, I came across some interesting mechanics and started looking into Breath of the Wild again, but still couldn't find the answer. Then, in mid-2026, I happened to test some parameters — and it actually worked. My dream finally came true, and the answer turned out to be surprisingly simple.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Version Support&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/715476"&gt;Wii U: v1.5.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/716804"&gt;Switch: v1.6.0, 1.9.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Core Feature&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;Guardians ignore Link and will actively hunt down all enemies across Hyrule.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Affected Units&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod works only for Stalker, Skywatcher, Turret, and Decayed Guardians. Guardian Scouts can be targeted by the above‑mentioned Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Amiibo Spawning&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Guardian Amiibo spawns only Guardian Stalkers, normally one at a time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Since the amiibo cannot be used in many situations, spawning via a save editor or other mod‑spawning tools is recommended.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Tip&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whistling makes Guardians turn toward Link, helping clear nearby enemies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Combat Rules&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Guardian attacks can still damage Link, and Guardians can also damage each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. If Link accidentally damages a Guardian, it will retaliate one single time, then drop aggro.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A Perfect Guard, dodging, or taking cover behind an obstacle will stop its attack and clear its aggro.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Dormant Guardians will fire once when they detect Link — the same counter methods work.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Urbosa's Fury still works against Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Enemy Behavior toward Guardians&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Main‑story bosses, Yiga Clan members, Hinoxes, and Molduga only target Link and will not fight Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Regular enemies (Bokoblins, Moblins, Lizalfos, Lynels, Chuchus, Octoroks, Wizzrobes, Pebblits, Keeses) will attack Guardians, but their attacks lack collision and damage registration against Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Taluses can fight Guardians with fully functional damage exchange.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Wolf Link has infinite HP and ignores Guardians, and is ignored by them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Optional Install Toggles&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. **Guardian Civil War**&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Guardian Stalkers, Skywatchers, Turrets and Decayed Guardians will attack each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. **Regular Enemy Ignore Link**&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Regular enemies listed above will not target Link. Guardians will still hunt and engage these enemies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;*Sandbox observation feature — not intended for regular gameplay.*&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. **Guardian Civil War + Regular Enemy Ignore Link**&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enables both above‑listed behaviors.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Additional Notes&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod does not alter Guardians colors. The ancient orange tint on Guardian Stalkers is a Graphics Pack effect. Skywatchers and Turrets already feature native ancient orange coloration in the base game.&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/readme_2fb92.rar" type="application/vnd.rar"/>
      <category>Other/Misc</category>
      <category>Game files</category>
    </item>
